WEBVTT

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.840
Excuse me, sir,
is there a commode?

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.600
Justin!

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.600
Quick, honey, take my picture.
I got the pyramid in my hand.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.440
Justin, you get back here
right now!

00:01:58.840 --> 00:01:59.840
No, stop!

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.240
- No, no! Stop him!
- Go back! Don't climb!

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:07.800
Wait, wait.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.840
Hold on. Easy, little boy.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.320
Okay, stop, child!
Stop right there. No!

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.400
No, no, no! There he goes.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.280
Justin!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.320
I've got him! I've got him!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.160
Outrage in Egypt tonight
as it was discovered

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.880
that the Great Pyramid of Giza
had been stolen

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:57.640
and replaced
by a giant inflatable replica.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.800
There is panic throughout the globe
as countries and citizens

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.840
try to protect
their beloved landmarks.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.800
Law enforcement still has no leads,

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.160
leaving everyone to wonder,
which of the world's villains

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.640
is responsible
for this heinous crime?

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.640
And where will he strike next?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.920
I'm having a bad, bad day

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.920
It's about time that I get my way

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.480
Steamrolling whatever I see

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.680
Freeze ray! Freeze ray! Freeze ray!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:13.800
I'm having a bad, bad day

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.800
If you take it personal,
that's okay

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.360
Watch, this is so fun to see

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.960
Despicable me

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.880
Morning, Gru!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.280
How you doing?

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.280
Hello, Fred.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:57.200
FYI, your dog has been leaving
little bombs all over my yard,

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.280
and I don't appreciate it.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.840
Sorry. You know dogs.
They go wherever they want to go.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.600
Unless they're dead.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.160
I'm joking!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.000
Although, it is true.
Anyway, have a good one.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.360
Okay. Yeah.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:19.200
Steamrolling whatever I see

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.440
Despicable me

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.200
I'm having a bad, bad day

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.800
If you take it personal,
that's okay

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.560
Despicable me

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.760
You've got to be pulling on my leg!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.680
Hello!

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.480
Cookies for sale.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.640
Go away. I'm not home.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.360
Yes, you are. I heard you.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:59.120
No, you didn't. This...

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.040
is a recording.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.280
- No, it isn't.
- Yes, it is.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:07.760
Watch this. Leave a message, beep.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.120
Goodbye, recorded message.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.960
Agnes, come on.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.280
Kyle!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:30.160
Bad dog! No!
No, no. Sit. My muffin.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.320
Gru!

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.840
Dr Nefario.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.520
I know how you must be feeling.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.880
I, too, have encountered
great disappointment,

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:43.240
but in my eyes, you will always be
one of the greats.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.280
What? What happened?

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.720
It's all over the news!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.720
Some fella just stole a pyramid.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.880
They're saying he makes
all other villains look...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.160
...lame.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.360
Assemble the minions!

